# Low Lifter Genre Presets

## Overview
Genre-specific Low Lifter settings for optimal bass enhancement across different styles of music.

---

## Preset 1: Hip-Hop Heavy

### Parameters
| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Crossover | 80 Hz |
| Slope | -24 dB/oct |
| Diffusion | 30% |
| Pre Gain | +8 dB |
| Low Cut | 50 Hz |
| Mode | Single |

### Characteristics
- Deep sub enhancement
- Aggressive harmonics
- Maximum impact

### Best For
- Trap bangers
- Hard hip-hop
- Aggressive productions

### Workflow Tips
- Use on 808 channel
- Check on phone speakers
- Balance with kick

---

## Preset 2: R&B Smooth

### Parameters
| Parameter | Value |
|-----------|-------|
| Crossover | 70 Hz |
| Slope | -12 dB/oct |
| Diffusion | 55% |
| Pre Gain | +4 dB |
| Low Cut | 35 Hz |
| Mode | Single |

### Characteristics
- Warm harmonics
- Smooth character
- Natural enhancement

